{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"A\n    \n      Grouped rows — site as header, envs indented below\n      Each site gets a bold header row, with its prod/stg/dev environments listed beneath it with indentation. One row per environment, clearly nested under the parent site.\n      \n        wpengine site list\n        \n          \n            ⬡ acme-corp\n            uuid-1234\n          \n          \n            PROD\n            acme-production\n            acme-production.wpengine.com\n          \n          \n            STG\n            acme-staging\n            acme-staging.wpengine.com\n          \n          \n            DEV\n            acme-dev\n            acme-dev.wpengine.com\n          \n          \n            ⬡ globex-wp\n            uuid-5678\n          \n          \n            └─ PROD   globex-wp   globex-wp.wpengine.com","choice":"grouped-rows","id":null,"timestamp":1779852766225}
